Z||000144||Dslice||06-19-2001||03:26 PM||||I dont think it would matter on car size in SOME cases. I mean, going 60-0 in zero seconds-car stops but you keep going, you might as well slam yourself in to the tree at 60mph. As far a making seatbelt use madatory. I think it should be a law, because yes it does affect others. The more injuries that occur in an accident means that the insurance companies have to shell out more $$$ which means I have to shell $$$. I dont like that, but Im sure there are some you like paying high premiums.<P>Rick<BR>86GT<BR>84COUP||||reg||1
