Z||000156||JSocha||06-20-2001||09:10 AM||||First, welcome to the forum, that is if you haven't changed your name and have been an old member.  You will meet alot of interesting people here who can help you.<P>Second, this is a real touchy subject of discussion and should have died long ago since it has outlived its usefull purpose, that is, if it had one to begin with.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>This type of topic, among many others, lead to nothing but flame wars, insults, name calling, forcing ones own opinion on another, belittling, badgering, etc. and ends up putting a "wedge" between members on this forum that does not need to be.  We are a community of Fiero owners with usefull information.  Not a community of Fiero owners who have nothing better to do then start wars because of an opinion, action and/or decision.<P>I hoped at best lastnight as no more responses were being posted that it would go down like a rusty submarine full of holes not to be raised, even if it had to end on a sour note between members which was sad to see and note to be viewed by others.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
