Z||000161||JSocha||06-20-2001||10:27 AM||||No one here is saying one can not comment, share their opinions,  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> (sometiems not a good thing) etc. and/or put a humourse spin on things based on someone elses comment that is way out there in left field and open if someone sees it.<P>I've tried in the past few posts to put some humor into this thread myself to lighten up the atmosphere that was once very hostile if not tense.  With that and with my Bart jumping out the 17th floor and dying, it was my way of saying I'm dying out of this, but through the goverening, yet open laws of Cartoons, I was able to be resurrected.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> So I came back and tried to keep the atmosphere light, and yes, make a comment to something you, someone else and I said hopefully could find funny.<P>I have no problems with people doing it with me.  Hey, if I am "dumb" enough to open the door to a slam, so be it.  However, if someone was to just single me out for the ridicule just "because", then I may become a little upset and wonder why.<P>I noticed that here after a couple and either I had missed something, there was some history here or from someplace else or for the sole purpose to illicit a response from the individual was not the best and was being used.  As questioned...<P>Funny thing is, it seemed when I would post a comment, someone else would get attacked only a few minutes later.  It felt as if though I was invisible.  Now that would be cool, cause then I could go into the ladies shower rooms!<P>Like I could tap you on the shoulder, pinch your *** and yet watch somebody else get slapped for my actions!<P>Does any of this make sense?  I'm tired today and battling my wifes cold she say I gave her.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
